A passing design of this technique (text-highlight: one phrase marked with a single unbroken stroke as it is said, the rest of the sentence stepping back), in this sandbox and on the tokens, for its mechanics, its timing and its standard. It uses: marker stroke, density from hierarchy. Its concept came from its own narration: find this slot's own rather than reusing its layout. Its words and figures are its own; yours come from this slot and its claims:
